{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜早晚有一兩陣微雨　留意周三稍後氣溫顯著下降\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261116-07.png\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股偏東氣流正逐漸影響廣東東部沿岸。本港地區今日(11月16日)天氣預測，大致多雲，早晚有一兩陣微雨。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約26度。吹微風，漸轉吹和緩偏東風，稍後離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日短暫時間有陽光。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本週後期早晚天氣清涼。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T23:29:27.295891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T23:09:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:40:58.058208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T23:22:45.944029+00:00","content_hash":"51bdcaf131d90f53b0a44b1d87dc985b4f9ace022a0ed28e027c97b902708f7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T23:29:27.295891+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}